Z||000012||william_thorniii||04-09-2001||06:14 PM||||Drew,<P>You should really put down your copy of "Tao of William" soon.  Seriously though, for my new body, I am actually considering a wing.  I hope to get to a boneyard this weekend to do some measuring.  If the holes line up or would be covered (as I suspect) by the rear spoiler that I am considering, I will gladly trade you a plain lid and springs (from the 86) for your formula lid and springs... you can keep the spoiler to sell on E-bay or something.  <P>Officer Monkeyman,<P>I still have that stuff for you.  Please accept my apologies.  If you send me your current mailing address I will try my best to get it out.  I am such a lazy bastard (DISCLAIMER: The lazy bastard WTIII has no affiliation with the more popular GT Bastard)<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||1
